:null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-23T08:25:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T18:39:35Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121670","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121670.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121670.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:34Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114800\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107446\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis issue only occurred with the vulkan (Forward mobile) renderer, and was caused because we attempted to create a vulkan swapchain while the screen was off, and the underlying surface was being destroyed. This occurs because the app goes through the following activity lifecycle when the screen is off: ON_CREATE -> ON_START -> ON_RESUME -> ON_PAUSE -> ON_STOP\r\n\r\nBetween the ON_PAUSE and ON_STOP lifecycle, the surface is being created, resized, then destroyed because the screen is off. The current vk thread logic however will kickstart the creation of the vulkan swapchain after the ON_PAUSE lifecycle, right after the surface is created and resized, and only stops when the ON_STOP lifecycle fires, by which point it's too late because the surface is already destroyed. The fix involves stopping the creation of the vulkan swapchain when ON_PAUSE fires and before the surface is destroyed. This allows to properly resume when the activity is resumed.\r\n\r\nFailing to create the vulkan swapchain would cause the creation of the `DisplayServerAndroid` to fail, causing its singleton to be destroyed. Part of the Android code however would access and use the `null` singleton without checking, causing the engine to crash. So additional logic was added to check that `DisplayServerAndroid::get_singleton() != nullptr` before using it.\r\n\r\nThe crashes manifested in the play store as a SIGSEV on `Callable::is_valid()`.\r\n\r\nMany thanks for @chanwoo0125 for providing repro steps in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107446#issuecomment-4995145133 which allowed to trace down the root cause of the issue!\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121670/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121670/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}